#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddright.gif, shady.gif
#: kidradd/comic123.htm:81
msgctxt "comic123#p1.2"
msgid "I can sneak you into over 100 different ROMs, man."
msgstr ""

#. comic123 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddstand.gif, shady.gif
#: kidradd/comic123.htm:133
msgctxt "comic123#p2.1"
msgid "That's bogus. Everyone knows you can't get into a game without destroying it."
msgstr ""

#. comic123 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddstand.gif, shady.gif
#: kidradd/comic123.htm:137
msgctxt "comic123#p2.2"
msgid "Moderator lies, man. It's real easy."
msgstr ""

#. comic123 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: game.gif, shady.gif
#: kidradd/comic123.htm:184
msgctxt "comic123#p3.1"
msgid "You want inside a game, don't force your way in, like the Mods do. Instead, trick the game into thinking you're part of it."
msgstr ""

#. comic123 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: shady.gif
#: kidradd/comic123.htm:236
msgctxt "comic123#p4.1"
msgid "All I gotta do is make some minor changes to your source code, and you're in."
msgstr ""

#. comic123 panel p5
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddstand.gif, shady.gif
#: kidradd/comic123.htm:288
msgctxt "comic123#p5.1"
msgid "Is that safe?"
msgstr ""

#. comic123 panel p5
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddstand.gif, shady.gif
#: kidradd/comic123.htm:292
msgctxt "comic123#p5.2"
msgid "Uh... yeah. But pay in advance."
msgstr ""

