#. comic125 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddstand.gif, shady.gif
#: kidradd/comic125.htm:77
msgctxt "comic125#p1.1"
msgid "So how do I get into the game?"
msgstr ""

#. comic125 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddstand.gif, shady.gif
#: kidradd/comic125.htm:81
msgctxt "comic125#p1.2"
msgid "Go downtown, and take a data transport to Section 112. There you'll find a folder titled \"Joe's Junk.\""
